   "id": "p01",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "The goose was nearly as tall as Rig's knee when the sound came. It was a hum, high up and far away, and it did not sound like anything alive.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
