  },
  {
   "id": "p02",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Rig knew that sound. He did not remember where from, and that frightened him more than remembering would have.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-09/p02.mp3",
   "durationSec": 7.25,
   "srcHash": "4b72730d77772ddaafa9215b7ee28dfa48d34a6e"
  },
  {
   "id": "p03",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "A small black machine came over the trees. It flew in straight lines, turned, and flew back along the next line, and then the next. It was flying a pattern.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "drone",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "running"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
      "pos": "left",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-09/p03.mp3",
   "durationSec": 11.4,
   "srcHash": "e5c13162bead1317ea40e841ae65f73ce7b00732"
  },
  {
   "id": "p04",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Rig understood what a pattern like that meant. The machine was not travelling anywhere. It was doing a search, and it would sweep this whole forest, line by line, until it had covered all of it.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "drone",
      "pos": "right",
      "state": "running"
     },
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "left",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-09/p04.mp3",
   "durationSec": 12.96,
   "srcHash": "1bab4d124cd465bbe788a6cac740686d4cd3fc94"
  },
  {
   "id": "p05",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Something old in him said: they have come for you. Something else, newer, said: hide.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "forest",
    "time": "dusk",
    "weather": "fog",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "hiding"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "tree",
